@guide A_BladesEdge
@name Blade's Edge Mountains (Sylvanaar & Toshley's Station)
@faction Alliance
@levels 66-68
@zone Blade's Edge Mountains
@chapter Outland
@desc Sylvanaar, the Bladespire and Bloodmaul ogres, Evergrove, Toshley's Station and the gronn chain with Baron Sablemane.
@next Both_Netherstorm

